-- E17-DEFINITIONS-PERIODS: canonical field registrations for the PLANNING (trying-to-conceive)
-- period onboarding. Sourced from the final verified legacy state (reference-repos/momna-onboarding-legacy,
-- 20260726102000_planning_schema.sql). Machine field IDs/options preserved verbatim.
-- `multi_choice`/`paired_choice` legacy formats become OBJECT-typed fields (selected options, or
-- per-row choices keyed by row id); `max_select` bounds are not enforced by the registry.
-- `lmp`/`treatment_expected_date` use the new minDaysFromNow/maxDaysFromNow relative bounds
-- (past_or_today + 60-day window; future_or_today + 180-day window) instead of fixed calendar dates.
ON CONFLICT (field_id) DO NOTHING;
